-- A call with a sentence inside a call without one, 32 levels deep. l4 render
-- used to rewrite an argument again to decide its brackets, so its time doubled
-- with each level, and this file would take hours.
GIVEN x IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@nlg %x% is shown
`shown` MEANS x

GIVEN x IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`fb` MEANS x

GIVEN p IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`top` MEANS `fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (`fb` (`shown` (p))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))
